==English==

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|UK}} {{IPA|/ˈɛm.bɹi.ɒn.ɪk/|lang=en}}

===Adjective===
{{en-adj}}

# {{context|embryology|lang=en}} Of or relating to an [[embryo]].
# {{context|figuratively|lang=en}} Something, especially a project, that is very new and is still [[evolving]]; something that has yet to reach its full potential.

